&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;札幌工場を開設　小樽紙器工場を閉鎖&lt;/p&gt;
